  <div class="pq-product-story__copy">
    <h2>A lightweight electric dirt bike for tight trails</h2>
    <p>A 55 kg bike is easier to push around the garage or turn around when a trail ends. The T-01 pairs its aluminum alloy frame with a 19-inch front wheel for rolling over roots and a 17-inch rear wheel. Hydraulic disc brakes give you control as you slow for turns. For adults and teens considering the T-01, start with Panquire’s 160 to 190 cm recommended rider height, then check reach, experience, and local age rules.</p>
  </div>
