<section class="pq-product-story">
  <div class="pq-product-story__image">
    <img src="{{ 'RiderHill.png' | asset_url }}" width="7680" height="4320" alt="Panquire T-01 rider on a hillside" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="pq-product-story__copy">
    <h2>Change power from the handlebar</h2>
    <p>The 60V system gives you three power settings and a stated top speed of 80 km/h. Use low for slow sections and select more power where the terrain and your experience call for it. With no clutch to work, you can focus on your line through a tight corner. When comparing bikes at this price, check how the controls and wheel sizes fit the riding you actually do.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="pq-product-story">
