  <div class="pq-product-story__copy">
    <h2>What affects electric dirt bike range?</h2>
    <p>The 60V 31.2Ah battery comes out so you can take it to an outlet and charge it with the supplied 6A charger. For an out-and-back ride, use the stated Eco range as a starting point. Sustained climbs, loose ground and higher speeds can shorten it. Leave enough charge for the return leg.</p>
